    "msvc": "Windows 11 x64, MSVC 19.51, Ninja Multi-Config. Both Debug and Release passed the four selected tests on predecessor ca0334468ec852a5ae4e3a093c73ba50737c894e. Coupling rerun passed both on this source after the layout fix.",
